{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something is stirring beneath Dimraeth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a ritual meant to grant power goes wrong, you and a handful of strangers awaken\u2014immortal, changed, and bound to forces long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across the war-torn lands of Mirkea, ancient ruins whisper of forgotten magic, and fractured peoples struggle to unite against the darkness. A powerful mage's last intervention gave you this second life\u2014but it is your choices, and those of your companions, that will shape what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey alone or with up to 8 players. Build a refuge in the wilds. Forge bonds of trust, love, and loyalty. And descend into a war that was never meant to be yours\u2014where fate may still be written by those brave enough to stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_1_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Begin_Story_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div>Awaken in a world on the edge of ruin. Gifted with immortality by a broken ritual, you must uncover ancient secrets, rally allies, and stand against the darkness spreading beneath Dimraeth. Your choices will shape the fate of Mirkea and your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_2_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Classes_and_Skills_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your hero with a flexible skill tree, distinct racial abilities, and powerful class synergies. Will you master magic as an elf, charge into battle as a minotaur, or carve a new path entirely? Forge a character as unique as your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_3_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Real-time_Combat_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master real-time elemental combat where every choice matters. Cast over 300 spells, combine elements for devastating effects, and evolve your build as you grow stronger. There are no random battles, only pure skill, strategy, and adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_4_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Stronghold_of_Allies_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve out a home in the wilds. Build, expand, and fill your stronghold with allies who bring new quests, upgrades, and possibilities \u2014 including romance. Your refuge will stand as a beacon of hope against the encroaching corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_5_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Living_World_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vibrant handcrafted world where forests, weather, and seasons shift around you. Influence the land through your actions, watch the world respond, and uncover the ancient magic that pulses beneath every stone and tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_6_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Play_with_Friends_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Band together with up to 8 players in seamless co-op. Build unique parties, tackle challenges from different angles, and return for new adventures. Whether you forge your story alone or with friends, every journey will be your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_7_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dimraeth is in active development toward Early Access. A new playtest is planned for Fall 2025, with Early Access launching in Fall 2026. Wishlist and follow us to get updates, early access to content, and help shape the future of Dimraeth with our community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2402680?t=1749212717","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749212717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749212717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749212717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something is stirring beneath Dimraeth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When a ritual meant to grant power goes wrong, you and a handful of strangers awaken\u2014immortal, changed, and bound to forces long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across the war-torn lands of Mirkea, ancient ruins whisper of forgotten magic, and fractured peoples struggle to unite against the darkness. A powerful mage's last intervention gave you this second life\u2014but it is your choices, and those of your companions, that will shape what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey alone or with up to 8 players. Build a refuge in the wilds. Forge bonds of trust, love, and loyalty. And descend into a war that was never meant to be yours\u2014where fate may still be written by those brave enough to stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/H