d adaptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_4_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Stronghold_of_Allies_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve out a home in the wilds. Build, expand, and fill your stronghold with allies who bring new quests, upgrades, and possibilities \u2014 including romance. Your refuge will stand as a beacon of hope against the encroaching corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_5_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Living_World_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vibrant handcrafted world where forests, weather, and seasons shift around you. Influence the land through your actions, watch the world respond, and uncover the ancient magic that pulses beneath every stone and tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Highlight_Title_6_S.png?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/Play_with_Friends_2.gif?t=1749212717\" /></div></p><p 